6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

26
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right...</font>

27
00:01:55,670 --> 00:01:56,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're close!</font>

28
00:01:57,340 --> 00:01:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are two enemies left...</font>

29
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are three of us...
It's three against two.</font>

30
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:06,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We might be able to do it with
one more contact if we do it well.</font>

31
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:09,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! All right!
Let's do it!</font>

32
00:02:09,690 --> 00:02:11,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! It's four against two!</font>

33
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:16,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, okay! I'm sorry.</font>

34
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:18,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Counting Akamaru,
it's four against two!</font>

35
00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's finish it quickly with
our new technique next!</font>

36
00:02:26,580 --> 00:02:30,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey. If necessary,
I'll do an awesome Shadow Clone,</font>

37
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so it'll be okay!</font>

38
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's reassuring...</font>

39
00:02:36,010 --> 00:02:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But my strategy comes first. Got it?</font>

40
00:02:40,970 --> 00:02:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah...</font>

41
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For that purpose,</font>

42
00:02:45,890 --> 00:02:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we have to catch up
before the sun sets at any cost.</font>

43
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know. Full throttle!</font>

44
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:05,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sun's starting to set...</font>

45
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neither Jirobo nor
Kidomaru have come.</font>

46
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems they're having
a hard time.</font>

47
00:03:11,370 --> 00:03:14,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter...
More important is Orochimaru-sama.</font>

48
00:03:19,130 --> 00:03:23,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've only completed one-third
of the journey in half a day...</font>

49
00:03:30,850 --> 00:03:33,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They all have Curse Marks, huh...</font>

50
00:03:33,980 --> 00:03:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No questions asked, huh?</font>

51
00:03:36,570 --> 00:03:38,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is gonna be different
than that time before</font>

52
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with your surprise attack...</font>

53
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too much interference...</font>

54
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, this is bad...</font>

55
00:03:48,490 --> 00:03:50,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know whether
we'll make it in time at this rate!</font>

56
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! We still can't catch up...</font>

57
00:04:06,390 --> 00:04:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, this is good enough.</font>

58
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:11,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll maintain this distance
and continue the pursuit...</font>

59
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:13,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What do you mean?</font>

60
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean we're delaying
the attack until dawn breaks.</font>

61
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get real!
We can't afford such leisure!</font>

62
00:04:21,690 --> 00:04:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right! Besides if we're going
to attack anyway,</font>

63
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">isn't it more advantageous
to use the darkness and attack?!</font>

64
00:04:28,450 --> 00:04:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For us the darkness works
to our advantage</font>

65
00:04:32,210 --> 00:04:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only the moment
we launch the attack.</font>

66
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:38,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be close to impossible
to grab Sasuke,</font>

67
00:04:38,710 --> 00:04:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">get away from them and escape
to a safe location</font>

68
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in just that one moment.</font>

69
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we couldn't get Sasuke
back in that one moment,</font>

70
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they'd probably just focus
on guarding the coffin.</font>

71
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:59,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that happens we wouldn't stand
a chance in the darkness.</font>

72
00:05:00,110 --> 00:05:01,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the contrary,</font>

73
00:05:01,570 --> 00:05:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for the part where they wouldn't
have to move needlessly,</font>

74
00:05:03,570 --> 00:05:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">suddenly they'd get the advantage.</font>

75
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:09,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be a different story
if we had Neji's Byakugan but...</font>

76
00:05:12,370 --> 00:05:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, come on.</font>

77
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:15,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't you forgetting Akamaru's nose
and mine as well??</font>

78
00:05:17,540 --> 00:05:20,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was sure to include your senses
of smell in the calculations!</font>

79
00:05:21,380 --> 00:05:24,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so, up ahead they have
the geographical advantage.</font>

80
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Plus...</font>

81
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:32,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I can't use my Jutsu
it'll be no use.</font>

82
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:38,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I seal off their movements
with Shadow Possession Jutsu...</font>

83
00:05:39,060 --> 00:05:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the effect would be reduced to half
if clouds were to cover the moon.</font>

84
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a drag but there are too many
dangers and uncertain elements.</font>

85
00:05:48,070 --> 00:05:49,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But!</font>

86
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

87
00:05:50,410 --> 00:05:51,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?</font>

88
00:05:51,370 --> 00:05:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the leader...</font>

89
00:05:53,290 --> 00:05:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll follow your instructions, Shikamaru!</font>

90
00:05:56,250 --> 00:05:57,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right. I'm counting on you!</font>

91
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:05,380
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Get Back</font>

92
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:05,380
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Container That Didn't
Make It In Time</font>

93
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:05,380
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">~</font>

94
00:05:59,380 --> 00:06:05,380
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">~</font>

95
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Tayuya!
Will we really make it in time?</font>

96
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just told to deliver
Sasuke-sama by tomorrow.</font>

97
00:06:19,350 --> 00:06:20,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By tomorrow, huh?</font>

98
00:06:21,690 --> 00:06:23,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't say that we have
lots of time to spare</font>

99
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I guess we'll make it in time.</font>

100
00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:26,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope so.</font>

101
00:07:21,330 --> 00:07:22,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama...</font>

102
00:07:30,090 --> 00:07:31,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

103
00:07:31,550 --> 00:07:33,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No Sasuke-kun... yet?</font>

104
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:38,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's running out of time...
He can't go on any longer.</font>

105
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama...</font>

106
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Several bodies have been
prepared for you!</font>

107
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:47,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... you could even use me
if necessary...</font>

108
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:52,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has to be Sasuke-kun...</font>

109
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:56,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long do you think I've waited?</font>

110
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a matter of urgency!</font>

111
00:07:58,740 --> 00:08:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage's Jutsu...</font>

112
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His curse was stronger
than expected!</font>

113
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this! Sealing Jutsu!
Reaper Death Seal!</font>

114
00:08:29,610 --> 00:08:31,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's this sensation?</font>

115
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seal!</font>

116
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My arm...</font>

117
00:09:07,310 --> 00:09:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't "reanimate" right now,
you'll lose everything!</font>

118
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that what you want?!</font>

119
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lose everything...</font>

120
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've selected and prepared
proficient bodies for you.</font>

121
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please leave it to me! Also...</font>

122
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll handle the recovery
of Sasuke-kun as well.</font>

123
00:09:33,340 --> 00:09:34,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall I use Kimimaro?</font>

124
00:09:47,770 --> 00:09:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you...</font>

125
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Third Hokage!</font>

126
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:11,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}Seal</b></font>

127
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:14,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Release!</font>

128
00:10:29,690 --> 00:10:32,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen well everyone!</font>

129
00:10:36,990 --> 00:10:40,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I shall release you from this prison...</font>

130
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:48,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, it'll only
be one of you!</font>

131
00:10:58,260 --> 00:11:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now all that's left is to
wake up Kimimaro-kun, huh?</font>

132
00:11:35,210 --> 00:11:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought...</font>

133
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:39,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wasn't summoned this time either.</font>

134
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto-sensei, I...</font>

135
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take care of your body.</font>

136
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your role is now finished.</font>

137
00:11:49,810 --> 00:11:53,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not Sound Ninja Five now,
Kimimaro-kun...</font>

138
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:02,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... still haven't...</font>

139
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your replacement has
already been found.</font>

140
00:12:10,450 --> 00:12:13,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He possesses power equal
to your "Earth" Curse Mark.</font>

141
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:16,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has been given
the "Heaven" Curse Mark.</font>

142
00:12:16,670 --> 00:12:19,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Additionally, he even
has the Kekkei Genkai.</font>

143
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:30,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wonder who's stronger...</font>

144
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:42,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?
Don't get too excited.</font>

145
00:12:54,750 --> 00:12:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto-sensei...</font>

146
00:13:00,210 --> 00:13:04,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-My life, how much do I have left?</font>

147
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:10,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't talk anymore...</font>

148
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:17,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-People... People are born
with some kind of meaning...</font>

149
00:13:19,060 --> 00:13:20,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since people are born</font>

150
00:13:21,110 --> 00:13:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there must be some kind
of important calling.</font>

151
00:13:24,530 --> 00:13:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Recently I've started thinking so...</font>

152
00:13:41,670 --> 00:13:43,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That the meaning for being born...</font>

153
00:13:45,130 --> 00:13:48,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For people finding the meaning is...</font>

154
00:13:49,850 --> 00:13:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the only freedom God has given.</font>

155
00:13:58,230 --> 00:14:00,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand what you want to say.</font>

156
00:14:00,690 --> 00:14:03,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, Orochimaru-sama
is now suffering.</font>

157
00:14:04,990 --> 00:14:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an unprecedented
difficult situation</font>

158
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'll mince no words.</font>

159
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:12,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What can you do now?</font>

160
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've now lost your value
as a "vessel."</font>

161
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:21,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A new vessel is heading this way.</font>

162
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

163
00:14:24,090 --> 00:14:26,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this point in time
it's too late but...</font>

164
00:14:37,350 --> 00:14:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! You said you were going
to let one person out of here.</font>

165
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:41,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to keep
your promise.</font>

166
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing?
Open the door now!</font>

167
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? There was another one?</font>

168
00:15:08,010 --> 00:15:08,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and...</font>

169
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... I...
I'll be eaten here right now...</font>

170
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:52,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll let you out of here...</font>

171
00:15:53,090 --> 00:15:56,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I shall grant you
just one wish.</font>

172
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:12,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My clan that was captured
for your experiments.</font>

173
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:13,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please release them.</font>

174
00:16:16,530 --> 00:16:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure. Consider it done.</font>

175
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to worry.</font>

176
00:16:23,370 --> 00:16:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your strong will is going to remain
as Residual Aura inside me.</font>

177
00:16:29,590 --> 00:16:32,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like you'll lose everything.</font>

178
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then your flesh is mine...</font>

179
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:49,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this Orochimaru-sama's body
will once again</font>

180
00:16:49,730 --> 00:16:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">be unable to reanimate
for several years.</font>

181
00:16:53,110 --> 00:16:54,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, there is the next time.</font>

182
00:16:58,910 --> 00:16:59,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-Indeed...</font>

183
00:17:00,290 --> 00:17:04,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my body no longer has value
as a vessel for Reanimation Jutsu.</font>

184
00:17:06,330 --> 00:17:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will now be difficult for me
who has lost everything...</font>

185
00:17:10,170 --> 00:17:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to find my own calling.</font>

186
00:17:14,010 --> 00:17:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've finally understood that...</font>

187
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:21,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's not me,</font>

188
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring in the new "vessel"
even if it costs me my life.</font>

189
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:31,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my repayment to
Orochimaru-sama...</font>

190
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the only redemption
for me for being worthless...</font>

191
00:17:51,670 --> 00:17:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold on a minute!</font>

192
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:55,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are we almost there?</font>

193
00:17:55,630 --> 00:17:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... It should still take a while.</font>

194
00:17:58,340 --> 00:17:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly...</font>

195
00:18:06,770 --> 00:18:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What were those idiots
Jirobo and Kidomaru doing?!</font>

196
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We caught up!</font>

197
00:18:18,990 --> 00:18:21,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! I'll take care of
this nice and quick!</font>

198
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Right away?!</font>

199
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this!</font>

200
00:18:36,010 --> 00:18:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multiple Fists Barrage!</font>

201
00:18:43,390 --> 00:18:44,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra in his palm...?!</font>

202
00:18:47,390 --> 00:18:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Transformation, eh?</font>

203
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

204
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way... His hands now...?!</font>

205
00:18:57,530 --> 00:19:00,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point if
I catch you before you do it!</font>

206
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Now, Kiba!
— Tunneling Fang!</font>

207
00:19:06,410 --> 00:19:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This was also a Shadow Clone?!</font>

208
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Luring Sakon into alignment with me...</font>

209
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and aiming at me from the start?!</font>

210
00:19:18,130 --> 00:19:20,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think you succeeded
just with that?!</font>

211
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

212
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been nailed.</font>

213
00:19:27,390 --> 00:19:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu succeeded!</font>

214
00:19:30,060 --> 00:19:31,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A diversion...</font>

215
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's coming!</font>

216
00:19:35,730 --> 00:19:38,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tayuya! What're you doing
idling away?!</font>

217
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No!</font>

218
00:19:41,490 --> 00:19:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you move forward?!</font>

219
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:45,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't dodge!</font>

220
00:19:50,210 --> 00:19:51,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you go!</font>

221
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:54,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice! Kiba, Shikamaru!</font>

222
00:19:55,170 --> 00:19:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru! Let's get out of here!</font>

223
00:19:58,710 --> 00:19:59,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

224
00:20:00,170 --> 00:20:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Punks...!</font>

225
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You scum... Messing around with us.</font>

226
00:20:08,060 --> 00:20:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were full of openings
just as I thought.</font>

227
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having too much ability individually
is also a problem...</font>

228
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It went well.</font>

229
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:18,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, it went just as calculated!</font>

230
00:20:19,230 --> 00:20:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just in terms of teamwork
ours was way better than theirs.</font>

231
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

232
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d0e2ad">hajimete kimi to shabetta</font></b></font></font></font>

