<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d0e2ad">would you think it was a bother if I approached you?</font></b></font></font></font>

242
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d0e2ad">sonna fuan o kakaete yuuki o dashite mita yo</font></b></font></font></font>

243
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:32,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d0e2ad">despite my doubts I worked up my courage</font></b></font></font></font>

244
00:21:32,300 --> 00:21:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#afd2e0">umaku shaberenai boku no fukiyou na hanashi</font></b></font></font></font>

245
00:21:32,300 --> 00:21:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#afd2e0">my clumsy attempts with words</font></b></font></font></font>

246
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:43,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#afd2e0">kimi wa mimi o sorasazu ni chanto kiite kureta yo</font></b></font></font></font>

247
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:43,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#afd2e0">you listened without turning away</font></b></font></font></font>

248
00:21:43,900 --> 00:21:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d3eca3">sore dake de boku wa ukarete shimau no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

249
00:21:43,900 --> 00:21:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d3eca3">no wonder I get carried away by you</font></b></font></font></font>

250
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d3eca3">dakedo kimi wa boku nante nantomo omottenai yo ne</font></b></font></font></font>

251
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d3eca3">but you don't feel anything for me do you?</font></b></font></font></font>

