00:22:23,460 --> 00:22:28,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#a7cce8">hajimete kimi to shabetta</font></b></font></font></font>

273
00:22:23,460 --> 00:22:28,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#a7cce8">for the first time I spoke to you</font></b></font></font></font>

274
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:41,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! To come this far
and have another one appear!</font>

275
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:44,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">On top of that, there's something out
of the ordinary about this guy.</font>

276
00:22:45,170 --> 00:22:47,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What's this bloodcurdling feeling
on my back?</font>

277
00:22:48,430 --> 00:22:52,180
